          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Reuters reported that China’s CXMT is considering building a second DRAM fab in Beijing’s Yizhuang district, in addition to the new fabs currently under construction in Shanghai and Hefei.  Including the Hefei and Shanghai fabs now under construction, CXMT’s total capacity is",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2084199116888756522",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-03T16:46:06.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 955
        },
        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "DigiTimes: 2027 DRAM/HBM capacity already sold out  According to a DigiTimes report, annual 2027 DRAM and HBM capacity has been fully booked out ahead of schedule.  NAND flash supply isn't as tight as DRAM, but bookings are expected to be completely filled by the end of this",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2084410347726004534",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-04T06:45:28.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 359
        },
        {
          "handle": "tphuang",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "CXMT is the engine supporting China's AI growth. As such, Reuters news of 2nd fab in Beijing (on top of ones under construction in Hefei & Shanghai) is another sign of growing demand for its product.  As AI continue to drive DRAM demand, 600k wpm seems just a fraction of what's",
          "url": "https://x.com/tphuang/status/2084362614377734255",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-04T03:35:47.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 70
        },
        {
          "handle": "QQ_Timmy",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "路透社報道 知情人士透露，中國市值最大的存儲芯片商長鑫存儲（CXMT）正計劃在北京亦莊建設第二座12英寸DRAM晶圓廠，選址就在現有北京工廠旁，並正與北京經濟技術開發區洽談融資。",
          "url": "https://x.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2084215805000962425",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-03T17:52:25.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 40
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "cluster_id": 1,
      "label": "nvidia / ai / jensen / amd",
      "own_count": 0,
