        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Korea, Eugene Investment & Securities: On the NVIDIA Rubin Ultra HBM despec  NVIDIA appears to be discussing a plan to configure the main version of Rubin Ultra with a 2 die structure, HBM4 8Hi, and 8 stacks, and to add an HBM4E 8Hi version at a later point. Assuming NVIDIA's",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2084428229763604899",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-04T07:56:31.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 71
        },
        {
          "handle": "jukan05",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "Put simply, the Rubin Ultra HBM despec is a supply issue. Not a demand issue.  I think as much additional HBM will be produced as the supply headroom freed up by the shift from 12Hi to 8Hi. It is not a problem at all.",
          "url": "https://x.com/jukan05/status/2084428931109912642",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-04T07:59:18.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 50
        },
        {
          "handle": "QQ_Timmy",
          "platform": "X",
          "text": "日本第三輪對華半導體出口管制8月1日生效，封鎖先進封裝核心設備  8月1日，日本經濟產業省修訂的第三輪對華半導體出口管制新規正式啟動實施，本輪管制打破此前聚焦晶圓前道製造的管控邏輯，將矛頭直指高端先進封裝核心設備，完成半導體全鏈條封鎖布局。  新規明確，適配 HBM 高帶寬內存、Chiplet",
          "url": "https://x.com/QQ_Timmy/status/2084266575411224796",
          "timestamp": "2026-08-03T21:14:10.000+08:00",
          "interaction": 36
        }
      ]
    }
